00 State Street Garage as it is the most accessible and one of the closest lots to us. It is right on the other side of the street with entrance on Surface Road.\n\nRESCHEDULE: If at anytime you need to modify your reservation pick-up or drop-off time, please reply to this email or give us a call at 617-855-6006. \n\nWe sincerely appreciate you for choosing Yamba. Thank you so much and have a great day!", "cancellation_notes": "Flexible Cancellation Policy – Book with Confidence!\n\nWe want to make booking your scooter rentals as easy and worry-free as possible! That’s why we offer a 100% free cancellation policy for scooter rentals—so you can book with confidence while still securing your spot.\n\nScooter Rentals – FREE Cancellations!\n\nCancel anytime before your rental start time and receive a full refund—no questions asked!  Need to change your rental time? No fees, no hassle—just reschedule for free!\n\nPhone: 617-855-6006 \nEmail: Support@rideyamba.com\nYamba - 199 State Street, Boston MA 02109", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/centralscoot/items/607319/images/1951814/", "pk": 1951814, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pxvPpVX2RRW0B99AFo12", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pxvPpVX2RRW0B99AFo12", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/centralscoot/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/centralscoot/items/607319/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pxvPpVX2RRW0B99AFo12", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/pxvPpVX2RRW0B99AFo12", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/centralscoot/items/607319/images/1978503/", "pk": 1978503, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel"